    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685160/extras/7e378b2d7531a442f3799bbd3497b4c0.poster.avif?t=1737858655\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685160/extras/7e378b2d7531a442f3799bbd3497b4c0.webm?t=1737858655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685160/extras/7e378b2d7531a442f3799bbd3497b4c0.mp4?t=1737858655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ball Coin Chapter 5 is an exciting Move and Dodge video game developed by Komodroid New Zealand. Take control of Rocky and navigate through challenging levels, avoiding enemies and collecting coins along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Objective: Dodge the enemies and collect all the coins to progress through the game. Three thrilling game modes await you - Endless, Hub, and Floor Is Lava. Enjoy endless hours of fun and strategic gameplay as you try to achieve the highest score! and rank on the leaderboard</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685160/extras/7e378b2d7531a442f3799bbd3497b4c0.poster.avif?t=1737858655\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685160/extras/7e378b2d7531a442f3799bbd3497b4c0.webm?t=1737858655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685160/extras/7e378b2d7531a442f3799bbd3497b4c0.mp4?t=1737858655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ball Coin Chapter 5 is an exciting Move and Dodge video game developed by Komodroid New Zealand. Take control of Rocky and navigate through challenging levels, avoiding enemies and collecting coins along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Objective: Dodge the enemies and collect all the coins to progress through the game. Three thrilling game modes await you - Endless, Hub, and Floor Is Lava. Enjoy endless hours of fun and strategic gameplay as you try to achieve the highest score! and rank on the leaderboard</p>",
